##Build + start everything:##

podman-compose up --build -d

##Check logs:##

podman-compose logs -f

##Check health:##

podman inspect --format='{{.State.Health.Status}}' container-dependencies-lab_db_1

##Restart everything:##

podman-compose down
podman-compose up --build -d

##Cleanup:##

podman-compose down
podman system prune -f
